            {
              "id": "1da9230a-8c61-4eee-b526-5cf08386bad4",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The Interrelationship of Leisure &amp; Play: Play as Leisure, Leisure as Play</strong></em> was written by Robert A. Stebbins, published by Palgrave Macmillan, October 12, 2015."
            },
            {
              "id": "deb1866a-7677-4b04-9ab3-d3df20a7613d",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "ba9622ba-123a-4def-822d-164fcd2a0e17",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Augmentative play is a special activity that substantially aids the pursuit of a larger, encompassing leisure activity. This approach to the study of play is unique. It recognizes the hundreds of activities in which play and leisure come together.</em>"
            },
